# Word temporary
~$*.doc*
~$*.dot*

# Word Auto Backup File
Backup of *.doc*

# Excel temporary
~$*.xls*

# Excel Backup File
*.xlk

# PowerPoint temporary
~$*.ppt*

# Visio autosave temporary files
*.~vsd*

#───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OpenSSL
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/OpenSSL.gitignore
#───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# OpenSSL-related files best not committed

## Certificate Authority
*.ca

## Certificate
*.crt

## Certificate Sign Request
*.csr

## Certificate
*.der

## Key database file
*.kdb

## OSCP request data
*.org

## PKCS #12
*.p12

## PEM-encoded certificate data
*.pem

## Random number seed
*.rnd

## SSLeay data
*.ssleay

## S/MIME message
*.smime

